n that has allied with the empire who has some kind of plans that deal with the skinlamds. So what I am wondering bout is what can of plans could Wraiths have for th skinlands.....long term plans?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, blanked out there for a moment; Tou Mu's presentation in KotE is lifted entirely from D&amp;D, so it takes a bit longer to get over that and contemplate things. She's typically extra-intent on getting back at Gui Ren and making their existences unpleasant as possible, so it probably involves using ghostly influence on mortals to up-end the local court, which being as south-facing as it is in the Quincunx, is hence dedicated to war and social change. Without the Hungry Dead where they are, their holdings are going to have sparse defenses, which means more corrupted Dragon Nests for Tou Mu and more Haunts for the official use of Yu Huang's forces.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And from my understanding of Kuei jin Artifacts....while basically Fetishes....are also made with Yin Spirits,aka Wraiths.... </div> </div> </div>Sometimes. I checked in DBDT just now, and they are an option after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T09:00:11-08:00","id":1034641,"title":"","content":"Wow so sorry bout all the typos. I am having to type this on my phone at work....and I have big thumbs. <br /> <br /> Ok, I am starting to get a idea on what kinds of plans The Yellow Springs could have. <br /> <